674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DwJL-5BgelkQ7kNvwEBXBsy&_nc_oc=AdocuoM42XfpXDInn8T2bbSpJjrd7OsoFIL8_2CYbuL-J93hvYlvpgqtYnDnoW9Cml8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6rRLpcTGQ3_cA3_7RRwzla_4_IgXVm1lJ_o0OxIw3KPg&oe=69FF4559"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xJSJeHIXmPMQ7kNvwEbX4-K&_nc_oc=AdovggpNubaoJO8JDQVMytteSpbdjLrFRKfyePr-QHvjs0l_NRAQoQIKpzmUF_0i2a8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7mNMDoJS-2QzMijQ31JRPi9iP7Hg4p8lO1kH9hPyDoNg&oe=69FF4E16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ydhR-eFNjrMQ7kNvwGkt1Wa&_nc_oc=Adrw76wU04iNUovENdAqlE1UhGofbRQDT5erkO0JgJtu4Q1ejZvZ4zOPOmHSGfJBXmg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5tlBMXE0hNL9ZCda_IJGs1KP8KNQytKO16VpMY5Gk8Uw&oe=69FF4A31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip